# Decision Records

Canonical: `docs/adr/` · `docs/project/DECISION_LOG.md` ·
`docs/templates/ADR_TEMPLATE.md`

## When required

Significant decisions that change provider boundaries, data sources, refresh /
cache / sidecar contracts, CI model, demo strategy, or other cross-cutting
design.

## Process

1. Search existing ADRs and DECISION_LOG.
2. Draft or update ADR before implementation is considered complete.
3. Record status, context, decision, consequences.
4. Product-visible decisions also get a PD-/D- entry in DECISION_LOG.
5. Update dependent architecture / handoff docs as needed.

Do not bury architectural decisions only in PR descriptions or chat.
